# The live SOLVENT backend every production build (Vercel, GitHub Pages)
# connects #/mint to by default: the real patched CDK mint and the SOLVENT
# evidence API on Railway (docs/DEPLOY-RAILWAY.md). Public URLs, not secrets.
# `#/mint?mint=<url>&evidence=<url>` still overrides them at run time.
